stateDiagram-v2
  state "서버 권위 미확인" as Unconfirmed
  state "현재 서버 확인된 목적별 grant" as Granted
  state "로컬 철회와 서버반영 대기" as Withdrawn
  state "선저장 pending mutation" as Pending
  state "확정 CAS 거절" as Cas
  state "재시도 대기" as Retry
  state "차단" as Blocked
  [*] --> Unconfirmed
  Unconfirmed --> Pending: bootstrap 후 명시적 선택 저장
  Pending --> Granted: exact newer confirmation 및 current authority
  Granted --> Withdrawn: false 선택 marker commit 직후
  Withdrawn --> Pending: denials 보존한 요청 저장
  Pending --> Cas: previous receipt conflict 409
  Cas --> Pending: CURRENT_CONSENT floor와 receipt·denials로 successor
  Pending --> Retry: network 결과 불명
  Retry --> Pending: 같은 pending replay
  Pending --> Blocked: identity·same-revision conflict 또는 저장 실패
  Granted --> Unconfirmed: session 교체·재확인
  note right of Withdrawn
    옛 grant replay는 effective deny를 뒤집지 못함
  end note
